    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuilding feels like a joke. like, why would i want to start from zero again? i'm 45. i don't have another 20 years to \"learn lessons.\" i've already paid the price. i feel like i'm just a ghost walking around a life that doesn't exist anymore. it's just a massive deficit now. i've put everything in and got nothing back.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
