      "content": "it's not just about the skills though. it's the math of it. everything i've done was an investment in a future that's dead. now i'm just stuck in this debt—emotionally, financially, just existence-wise. it feels like the only way to actually stop the bleeding and settle the account is to just stop playing. if the game is rigged and the losses are total, isn't it just more logical to walk away than to keep sinking more into a void?",
